WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.132 --> 00:00:17.874
Monkey sailed over the ocean for a long time.

2
00:00:18.935 --> 00:00:20.997
Finally he arrived at a new land.

3
00:00:23.038 --> 00:00:26.601
He walked for many years, visiting towns and meeting people.

4
00:00:27.562 --> 00:00:29.864
But he didn't find a sage anywhere.

5
00:00:30.972 --> 00:00:33.934
Eventually he came to mountains covered in thick forest.

6
00:00:36.376 --> 00:00:39.698
He headed up a steep mountain trail and soon heard chopping.

7
00:00:41.439 --> 00:00:43.320
A woodcutter was chopping firewood.

8
00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:46.282
"Hello," said Monkey.

9
00:00:46.302 --> 00:00:48.644
"Are there any sages in these mountains?"

10
00:00:49.384 --> 00:00:50.925
The woodcutter dropped his ax.

11
00:00:53.327 --> 00:00:54.768
a monkey!"

12
00:00:55.108 --> 00:00:55.548
he said.

13
00:00:55.568 --> 00:00:57.650
"And you're talking!"

14
00:00:58.751 --> 00:01:00.552
"Yes, I am," said Monkey.

15
00:01:01.652 --> 00:01:02.533
I want to live forever.

16
00:01:03.174 --> 00:01:04.555
Do you know where I can find a sage?"

17
00:01:05.796 --> 00:01:07.218
woodcutter scratched his head.

18
00:01:07.238 --> 00:01:09.600
"Well, yes," he said.

19
00:01:10.701 --> 00:01:13.063
sage named Subodhi lives on this mountain.

20
00:01:13.704 --> 00:01:14.805
He is very wise."

21
00:01:16.487 --> 00:01:17.287
was excited.

22
00:01:17.868 --> 00:01:18.669
"Where can I find him?"

23
00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:23.613
"Just follow this trail, and you will come to his home," said the woodcutter.

24
00:01:23.633 --> 00:01:25.115
"Thank you!"

25
00:01:25.435 --> 00:01:26.036
said Monkey.

26
00:01:29.708 --> 00:01:32.550
He waved good-bye to the woodcutter and ran up the trail.

27
00:01:33.711 --> 00:01:36.993
Soon he saw a temple built into the side of the mountain.

28
00:01:38.575 --> 00:01:41.837
Subodhi was sitting with his students in the main room of his temple.

29
00:01:43.038 --> 00:01:44.879
He looked at his oldest student.

30
00:01:44.899 --> 00:01:48.141
"Please go to the door," said Subodhi.

31
00:01:49.322 --> 00:01:50.963
new student is about to arrive.

32
00:01:51.364 --> 00:01:51.784
Let him in."

33
00:01:53.085 --> 00:01:54.506
student looked confused.

34
00:01:54.526 --> 00:01:58.388
"Okay, Master," he said.

35
00:01:58.628 --> 00:02:00.889
student got up and went to the door of the temple.

36
00:02:05.350 --> 00:02:06.310
He looked outside.

37
00:02:06.370 --> 00:02:08.971
"Hello!" called Monkey.

38
00:02:08.991 --> 00:02:10.912
"I'm here to see Subodhi!"

39
00:02:13.593 --> 00:02:16.693
A moment later Monkey was standing in front of the sage.

40
00:02:16.713 --> 00:02:19.994
"I want to be your student," said Monkey.

41
00:02:21.115 --> 00:02:23.015
you're just a monkey," said Subodhi.

42
00:02:23.035 --> 00:02:26.784
"How can you be my student?"

43
00:02:27.084 --> 00:02:28.205
Monkey laughed.

44
00:02:28.225 --> 00:02:29.665
"I might be a monkey.

45
00:02:30.525 --> 00:02:32.926
But I can walk and talk and do many other things.

46
00:02:35.027 --> 00:02:37.287
traveled almost 13 years to get here.

47
00:02:38.267 --> 00:02:39.728
I'm sure I can be your student."

48
00:02:41.348 --> 00:02:42.829
stared at Monkey for a moment.

49
00:02:42.849 --> 00:02:45.049
"Who are your parents?"

50
00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:45.990
he asked.

51
00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:49.031
Monkey scratched his head.

52
00:02:50.271 --> 00:02:51.931
don't have parents," he said.

53
00:02:51.951 --> 00:02:55.120
"I was born from a rock."

54
00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:56.621
"Interesting," said Subodhi.

55
00:02:57.561 --> 00:02:59.582
were probably created by Heaven and Earth.

56
00:03:00.722 --> 00:03:01.803
You may be my student.

57
00:03:02.743 --> 00:03:03.303
need a name."

58
00:03:04.304 --> 00:03:05.484
He thought for a moment.

59
00:03:06.545 --> 00:03:08.526
"I will call you Sun Wukong."

60
00:03:13.388 --> 00:03:17.589
For the next seven years, Sun Wukong lived in Subodhi's temple.

61
00:03:18.650 --> 00:03:23.952
The monkey spent his days meditating, listening to his teacher's lessons, and doing chores.

62
00:03:26.208 --> 00:03:30.731
One day, while Subodhi was giving a lesson, Wukong started to dance.

63
00:03:34.073 --> 00:03:34.453
stood up.

64
00:03:34.473 --> 00:03:37.154
"How dare you dance while I'm teaching?"

65
00:03:37.395 --> 00:03:37.935
he shouted.

66
00:03:41.737 --> 00:03:43.038
sorry," said Wukong.

67
00:03:43.058 --> 00:03:45.619
"But I was so happy, I needed to dance!"

68
00:03:46.900 --> 00:03:48.121
Subodhi calmed down.

69
00:03:48.981 --> 00:03:49.601
"You're happy?"

70
00:03:49.621 --> 00:03:52.223
"Yes," said the monkey.

71
00:03:52.243 --> 00:03:53.884
"I love learning from you."

72
00:03:55.072 --> 00:03:57.454
"Wukong, you have been here a long time.

73
00:03:58.534 --> 00:03:59.935
What would you like to learn from me?"

74
00:04:00.276 --> 00:04:01.056
asked Subodhi.

75
00:04:02.857 --> 00:04:04.979
shrugged. "I don't know.

76
00:04:05.499 --> 00:04:06.560
You tell me what I should learn."

77
00:04:07.781 --> 00:04:11.763
"Well," said Subodhi, "I can teach you how to tell the future.

78
00:04:12.184 --> 00:04:12.964
Would you like that?"

79
00:04:12.984 --> 00:04:15.586
"Maybe," said Wukong.

80
00:04:15.606 --> 00:04:17.327
"Will it make me live forever?"

81
00:04:17.347 --> 00:04:20.109
"Of course not," said Subodhi.

82
00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:22.871
forget it," said Wukong.

83
00:04:22.891 --> 00:04:26.020
"Teach me something else."

84
00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:27.482
"Hmm," said Subodhi.

85
00:04:27.502 --> 00:04:30.664
"How about some magic breathing exercises?"

86
00:04:30.684 --> 00:04:33.426
"Will they make me live forever?"

87
00:04:33.787 --> 00:04:34.627
asked Wukong.

88
00:04:34.647 --> 00:04:38.751
"No," said Subodhi, frowning.

89
00:04:38.771 --> 00:04:42.634
"Then I'm not interested," said Wukong.

90
00:04:43.755 --> 00:04:45.316
Subodhi became angry.

91
00:04:46.637 --> 00:04:50.020
He stood up and knocked Wukong on the head three times.

92
00:04:53.183 --> 00:04:54.384
Then he left the room.

93
00:04:59.236 --> 00:05:01.079
"Wukong," said another student.

94
00:05:01.099 --> 00:05:03.222
"You were very rude to Master!"

95
00:05:04.404 --> 00:05:05.966
The other students all agreed.

96
00:05:07.008 --> 00:05:08.650
Wukong, however, smiled.

97
00:05:09.672 --> 00:05:14.619
None of the other students knew it, but Subodhi had given him a secret message.
